          "body": "It is possible to create a separate list view tab by creating and App Page and adding the list view on the page canvas.\n\nWe can add an app page to the console navigation.\n\nPROS: Once a record was opened, subtab still works.\n\nCONS: It does not support console sidebar (list view )",
