          "body": "NOTE — 2026-07-28 reconciliation: still unresolved after three weeks. This is a writeup-only task (\\~1-2h) and it is gating how Reps navigate between Players and Referrers in the Console. Related to POC-25 (Improve Player Record Type Visibility) — resolve them together. RECOMMENDATION: give it a date this week or move it explicitly to the Phase 2 backlog. Leaving it undated in POC Sprint after the sprint has closed is the worst of the three options.",
